# Industrial Sound Generator VST3 - Example Preset

This is an example preset file (XML format) showing parameter values for the plugin.

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Parameters>
  <!-- Sampler Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="sample" value="0"/>
  <Parameter name="pitch" value="0.0"/>
  <Parameter name="speed" value="1.0"/>
  <Parameter name="attack" value="10.0"/>
  <Parameter name="release" value="100.0"/>
  
  <!-- Bitcrusher Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="bitcrusher_depth" value="0.5"/>
  <Parameter name="bitcrusher_mix" value="0.8"/>
  
  <!-- Ring Modulator Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="ringmod_freq" value="150.0"/>
  <Parameter name="ringmod_mix" value="0.4"/>
  
  <!-- Distortion Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="distortion_drive" value="5.0"/>
  <Parameter name="distortion_tone" value="8000.0"/>
  <Parameter name="distortion_mix" value="0.6"/>
  
  <!-- Multiband EQ Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="multiband_low" value="-3.0"/>
  <Parameter name="multiband_mid" value="0.0"/>
  <Parameter name="multiband_high" value="6.0"/>
  
  <!-- Reverb Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="reverb_room" value="0.7"/>
  <Parameter name="reverb_damp" value="0.5"/>
  <Parameter name="reverb_wet" value="0.4"/>
  <Parameter name="reverb_dry" value="0.6"/>
  
  <!-- Master Parameters -->
  <Parameter name="master_gain" value="-3.0"/>
</Parameters>
```

## How to Use

1. Save this preset with a meaningful name: `MyPreset.xml`
2. Place in the presets directory:
   - **macOS:** `~/Library/Application Support/IndustrialGenerator/Presets/`
   - **Windows:** `%APPDATA%\IndustrialGenerator\Presets\`
   - **Linux:** `~/.config/IndustrialGenerator/Presets/`
3. Open the plugin in your DAW
4. Go to **Master Tab**
5. Click **Load Preset** and select your preset

## Common Presets

### Gritty Kick
```xml
<Parameter name="bitcrusher_depth" value="0.9"/>
<Parameter name="bitcrusher_mix" value="1.0"/>
<Parameter name="distortion_drive" value="7.0"/>
<Parameter name="multiband_low" value="6.0"/>
<Parameter name="reverb_wet" value="0.1"/>
```

### Metallic Bell
```xml
<Parameter name="ringmod_freq" value="200.0"/>
<Parameter name="ringmod_mix" value="0.9"/>
<Parameter name="distortion_drive" value="2.0"/>
<Parameter name="reverb_room" value="0.9"/>
<Parameter name="reverb_wet" value="0.6"/>
```

### Harsh Snare
```xml
<Parameter name="distortion_drive" value="8.0"/>
<Parameter name="distortion_tone" value="12000.0"/>
<Parameter name="multiband_high" value="8.0"/>
<Parameter name="bitcrusher_depth" value="0.6"/>
```
